# Post Resource Request

## User Story

As a student, I want to post a request for learning resources on a specific topic so that peers can recommend suitable resources.

## Feature Description

This feature allows students to create a learning resource request by specifying the topic and describing the type of resource they need.

## Proposed Details

- Enter the topic.
- Describe the required learning resource.
- Submit the request.
- Allow peers to view the request.
- Allow peers to recommend suitable resources.

## Expected Outcome

Students can easily request learning materials and receive useful recommendations from their peers.
